523
00:29:23,940 --> 00:29:27,260
Cogsworth Quackleton.

524
00:29:27,260 --> 00:29:30,820
I take him out of my bucket and I go.

525
00:29:33,140 --> 00:29:35,740
You know, get down, there, what do you see?

526
00:29:36,300 --> 00:29:42,100
Chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk chk.

