00:29:52,820 --> 00:29:55,340
I wasn't going to break them, but if you want to break them, that's fine.

531
00:29:55,340 --> 00:29:56,340
No, I'm joking.

532
00:29:56,340 --> 00:29:57,340
No, I don't want them to break.

533
